From DLA-260 2026-06-05 14:00:23 +03:00
From: EsegyCode <nickofffffff@gmail.com>
Subject: [DLA-260] Sync sandbox: Tailwind v4 + UI polish + Zod + Jest

Composite patch that lands every DLA-25x / 35x / 45x change as a single commit. Apply on top of the v0-frontend baseline (post DLA-100 merge) to get a feature branch with the fully-styled, validated, and tested site. Replaces styles.css with globals.css, adds postcss.config.mjs + a ui/ primitives layer + zod-backed content validation + Jest + RTL. The DLA-251/252/351/451 ticket split still exists in BACKLOG.md for traceability, but the implementation now lands in one commit so the user only needs to apply one patch.

